.com/drive/folders/1A21L12OVaYs3RGNBEFSHp41IvVeDOAOK?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sooyumochi/works/71", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2897232, "client_id": 2504001, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e5dedce/uploads/origins/c7cbf817-cc44-4713-adaa-9276b6a653df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=512fbc493c73f74d2e4bfc1b26ed6334", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e5dedce/uploads/origins/c7cbf817-cc44-4713-adaa-9276b6a653df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8af144686256907869cc4efc248eb289", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、sooyuさん！はじめまして。突然のリクエスト失礼します。SkebのHPで作品を拝見し、作風がとても気に入りました！私のビエラFFXIVのOCを描いていただきたいです。\n\n細かいところはお任せしますので、自由に描いてください！オッドカラーの瞳と、左頬の顔のマークに注目してください。耳が大きいです。  \n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cjt4EIwN8LVJQoOhtW-DsjTYUjBVG3Uy", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sooyumochi/works/70", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2897232, "client_id": 3441529, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9486ff7/uploads/origins/e5f15d4f-69de-4be0-b6c0-1dd78b03faf2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db859b40d56b0666268554d0cd70e3c9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9486ff7/uploads/origins/e5f15d4f-69de-4be0-b6c0-1dd78b03faf2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=749f704ebaafe49faed6e30248f9cae3", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのア